Make pose 15 the clearly visible horizontal KO figure in row 4 column 3, with head LEFT, fully inside its own cell and separated from pose 14. Keep pose 14 the clearly visible rising uppercut in row 4 column 2, with fist up and separated from pose 15. Keep pose 13 in row 4 column 1 and pose 16 in row 4 column 4. All bodies face RIGHT except the required KO head direction. Preserve connected anatomy, hands attached, feet attached, full head/hair/jacket in every cell. No grid, floor, shadow, background, text, logo, watermark, checkerboard, effects.
